# Frontend environment variables (optional)
#
# Default: frontend `/api` call karta hai aur Vite proxy usay
# http://localhost:3000 par bhej deta hai (vite.config.js dekhein).
#
# Agar backend kisi aur host/port par hai to `.env` file bana kar ye set karein:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
